ator,inspirational quote AI\"/><meta name=\"robots\" content=\"index, follow\"/><meta name=\"googlebot\" content=\"index, follow, max-video-preview:-1, max-image-preview:large, max-snippet:-1\"/><link rel=\"canonical\" href=\"https://meigenai.org\"/><meta property=\"og:title\" content=\"Meigen AI — AI Quote Studio\"/><meta property=\"og:description\" content=\"Generate original quotes and turn them into brand-ready visual cards with Meigen AI. 20+ templates, batch export, multi-platform sizes. Free to try.\"/><meta property=\"og:url\" content=\"https://meigenai.org\"/><meta property=\"og:site_name\" content=\"Meigen AI\"/><meta property=\"og:locale\" content=\"en_US\"/><meta property=\"og:image\" content=\"https://meigenai.org/og-image.jpg\"/><meta property=\"og:image:width\" content=\"1200\"/><meta property=\"og:image:height\" content=\"630\"/><meta property=\"og:image:alt\" content=\"Meigen AI — Turn Ideas into Shareable Quotes in 30 Seconds\"/><meta property=\"og:type\" content=\"website\"/><meta name=\"twitter:card\" content=\"summary_large_image\"/><meta name=\"twitter:title\" content=\"Meigen AI — AI Quote Studio\"/><meta name=\"twitter:description\" content=\"Generate original quotes and turn them into brand-ready visual cards with Meigen AI. 20+ templates, batch export, multi-platform sizes. Free to try.\"/><meta name=\"twitter:image\" content=\"https://meigenai.org/og-image.jpg\"/><link rel=\"icon\" href=\"/favicon.ico?favicon.0x3dzn~oxb6tn.ico\" sizes=\"256x256\" type=\"image/x-icon\"/><link rel=\"icon\" href=\"/favicon.svg\"/><link rel=\"apple-touch-icon\" href=\"/apple-touch-icon.png\"/><link href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Playfair+Display:wght@400;500;600;700&amp;family=Space+Grotesk:wght@300;400;500;600;700&amp;family=JetBrains+Mono:wght@400;500&amp;display=swap\" rel=\"stylesheet\"/><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/03~yq9q893hmn.js\" noModule=\"\"></script></head><body class=\"antialiased\"><div hidden=\"\"><!--$--><!--/$--></div><main><header class=\"fixed top-0 left-0 right-0 z-[100]\"><div class=\"flex items-center justify-between px-6 md:px-12 py-5\" style=\"background:linear-gradient(to bottom, rgba(12,12,14,0.95), rgba(12,12,14,0));backdrop-filter:blur(12px);-webkit-backdrop-filter:blur(12px)\"><a class=\"font-[family-name:var(--font-display)] text-2xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-[#f5f0e8]\" href=\"/\">Meigen<span class=\"text-[#d4a853]\">.</span></a><nav class=\"hidden md:flex items-center gap-8\"><a class=\"text-sm font-medium text-[#a09b94] hover:text-[#f5f0e8] transition-colors duration-200\" href=\"/#how-it-works\">How It Works</a><a class=\"text-sm font-medium text-[#a09b94] hover:text-[#f5f0e8] transition-colors duration-200\" href=\"/#templates\">Templates</a><a class=\"text-sm font-medium text-[#a09b94] hover:text-[#f5f0e8] transition-colors duration-200\" href=\"/#pricing\">Pricing</a><a class=\"text-sm font-medium text-[#a09b94] hover:text-[#f5f0e8] transition-colors duration-200\" href=\"/#faq\">FAQ</a><a class=\"text-sm font-medium px-6 py-2.5 border border-[rgba(245,240,232,0.08)] rounded-full text-[#f5f0e8] hover:border-[#d4a853] hover:text-[#d4a853] transition-all duration-200\" href=\"/login\">Log in</a></nav><button class=\"md:hidden text-[#f5f0e8]\" aria-label=\"Toggle menu\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-menu\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M4 5h16\"></path><path d=\"M4 12h16\"></path><path d=\"M4 19h16\"></path></svg></button></div></header><section class=\"relative min-h-screen flex flex-col justify-center items-center text-center px-6 md:px-12 pt-32 pb-20 overflow-hidden\"><div class=\"absolute pointer-events-none\" style=\"width:600px;height:600px;border-radius:50%;background:radial-gradient(circle, rgba(212,168,83,0.08) 0%, transparent 70%);top:10%;left:50%;transform:translateX(-50%)\"></div><span class=\"relative z-10 font-[family-name:var(--font-mono)] text-xs tracking-[0.15em] uppercase text-[#d4a853] mb-6\">AI Quote Studio</span><h1 class=\"relative z-10 font-[family-name:var(--font-display)] font-semibold leading-[1.1] tracking-tight max-w-[900px]\" style=\"font-size:clamp(40px, 5.5vw, 72px)\">Stop Staring at Blank Screens.<br/>Start Posting Quotes That Get Noticed.</h1><p class=\"relative z-10 text-lg text-[#a09b94] max-w-[560px] mt-6 mb-12 leading-relaxed\">Meigen AI generates original quotes and turns them into brand-ready visual cards — in 30 seconds. No design skills. No blank Canvas.</p><div class=\"relative z-10 w-full max-w-[640px] mb-4\"><div class=\"flex gap-3 bg-[#141416] border border-[rgba(245,240,232,0.08)] rounded-3xl p-2 focus-within:border-[#d4a853] transition-colors duration-300\"><input type=\"text\" placeholder=\"Enter a topic, e.g. morning motivation\" class=\"flex-1 bg-transparent border-none px-5 py-3.5 text-[#f5f0e8] placeholder-[#6b6560] text-base outline-none font-[family-name:var(--font-sans)]\" value=\"\"/><button class=\"px-8 py-3.5 bg-[#d4a853] text-[#0c0c0e] rounded-xl font-semibold text-[15px] whitespace-nowrap hover:bg-[#e8bc6a] hover:-translate-y-px transition-all duration-200\">Generate</button></div></div><p class=\"relative z-10 text-[13px] text-[#6b6560] mb-12\">No signup required. Try it once free.</p><div class=\"relative z-10 w-full max-w-[480px] aspect-square bg-gradient-to-br from-[#1a1a1c] to-[#0c0c0e] border border-[rgba(245,240,232,0.08)] rounded-2xl p-12 flex flex-col justify-center items-center text-center overflow-hidden\"><div class=\"absolute -top-1/2 -left-1/2 w-[200%] h-[200%] pointer-events-none\" style=\"background:radial-gradient(circle at 30% 30%, rgba(212,168,83,0.05), transparent 50%)\"></div><p class=\"relative z-10 font-[family-name:var(--font-display)] text-[28px] leading-[1.4] text-[#f5f0e8]\">“The only way to do great work is to love what you do.”</p><div class=\"relative z-10 w-10 h-px bg-[#d4a853] my-4\"></div><span class=\"relative z-10 text-sm text-[#d4a853] tracking-[0.1em] uppercase\">— Steve Jobs</span></div></section><section id=\"how-it-works\" class=\"px-6 md:px-12 py-[120px] max-w-[1200px] mx-auto\"><span class=\"font-[family-name:var(--font-mono)] text-xs tracking-[0.15em] uppercase text-[#d4a853]\">How It Works</span><h2 class=\"font-[family-name:var(--font-display)] font-semibold leading-[1.2] tracking-tight mt-4 mb-4\" style=\"font-size:clamp(32px, 4vw, 48px)\">From Idea to Post in 30 Seconds</h2><p class=\"text-lg text-[#a09b94] max-w-[560px] leading-relaxed\">Three steps. No learning curve. No design software.</p><div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-8 mt-16\"><div class=\"bg-[#141416] border border-[rgba(245,240,232,0.08)] rounded-2xl p-10 hover:border-[rgba(245,240,232,0.15)] transition-colors duration-300\"><div class=\"font-[family-name:var(--font-display)] text-5xl font-bold text-[#d4a853] opacity-30 leading-none mb-6\">01</div><h3 class=\"font-[family-name:var(--font-display)] text-[22px] font-semibold mb-3\">Enter Your Topic</h3><p class=\"text-[15px] text-[#a09b94] leading-relaxed\">Type a word or theme. &quot;Leadership.&quot; &quot;Monday motivation.&quot; &quot;Self-care.&quot; Our AI writes an original quote matched to your style.</p></div><div class=\"bg-[#141416] border border-[rgba(245,240,232,0.08)] rounded-2xl p-10 hover:border-[rgba(245,240,232,0.15)] transition-colors duration-300\"><div class=\"font-[family-name:var(--font-display)] text-5xl font-bold text-[#d4a853] opacity-30 leading-none mb-6\">02</div><h3 class=\"font-[family-name:var(--font-display)] text-[22px] font-semibold mb-3\">Pick a Template</h3><p class=\"text-[15px] text-[#a09b94] leading-relaxed\">Choose from brand-ready layouts. Your colors, your logo, your fonts — applied automatically. No manual tweaking.</p></div><div class=\"bg-[#141416] border border-[rgba(245,240,232,0.08)] rounded-2xl p-10 hover:border-[rgba(245,240,232,0.15)] transition-colors duration-300\"><div class=\"font-[family-name:var(--font-display)] text-5xl font-bold text-[#d4a853] opacity-30 leading-none mb-6\">03</div><h3 class=\"font-[family-name:var(--font-display)] text-[22px] font-semibold mb-3\">Download and Post</h3><p class=\"text-[15px] text-[#a09b94] leading-relaxed\">Export as PNG or JPG. Any size. Single or batch. Ready for Instagram, X, LinkedIn, or your newsletter.</p></div></div></section><section id=\"use-cases\" class=\"px-6 md:px-12 py-[120px] max-w-[1200px] mx-auto\"><span class=\"font-[family-name:var(--font-mono)] text-xs tracking-[0.15em] uppercase text-[#d4a853]\">Use Cases</span><h2 class=\"font-[family-name:var(--font-display)] font-semibold leading-[1.2] tracking-tight mt-4 mb-4\" style=\"font-size:clamp(32px, 4vw, 48px)\">Built for Creators Who Post Daily</h2><p class=\"text-lg text-[#a09b94] max-w-[560px] leading-relaxed\">Whether you manage one brand or ten, Meigen AI keeps your quote content flowing.</p><div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-6 mt-16\"><div class=\"bg-[#141416] border border-[rgba(245,240,232,0.08)] rounded-2xl p-10 hover:border-[#d4a853] hover:-translate-y-0.5 transition-all duration-300\"><h3 class=\"font-[family-name:var(--font-display)] text-[22px] font-semibold mb-4\">Social Media Managers</h3><p class=\"text-[15px] text-[#a09b94] leading-relaxed\">Generate 7 on-brand quote cards in 2 minutes. Same fonts. Same colors. Same spacing. Your feed looks intentional, not scattered.</p></div><div class=\"bg-[#141416] border border-[rgba(245,240,232,0.08)] rounded-2xl p-10 hover:border-[#d4a853] hover:-translate-y-0.5 transition-all duration-300\"><h3 class=\"font-[family-name:var(--font-display)] text-[22px] font-semibold mb-4\">Coaches &amp; Consultants</h3><p class=\"text-[15px] text-[#a09b94] leading-relaxed\">AI generates original quotes in your voice — reflective, direct, or uplifting. Each card carries your logo and brand colors.</p></div><div class=\"bg-[#141416] border border-[rgba(245,240,232,0.08)] rounded-2xl p-10 hover:border-[#d4a853] hover:-translate-y-0.5 transition-all duration-300\"><h3 class=\"font-[family-name:var(--font-display)] text-[22px] font-semibold mb-4\">Personal Brand Builders</h3><p class=\"text-[15px] text-[#a09b94] leading-relaxed\">Create original quote content that looks commissioned. Clean typography. Professional layout. Your name on it.</p></div><div class=\"bg-[#141416] border border-[rgba(245,240,232,0.08)] rounded-2xl p-10 hover:border-[#d4a853] hover:-translate-y-0.5 transition-all duration-300\"><h3 class=\"font-[family-name:var(--font-display)] text-[22px] font-semibold mb-4\">Newsletter Creators</h3><p class=\"text-[15px] text-[#a09b94] leading-relaxed\">Every issue opens with a striking quote card — your brand colors, your voice, your visual signature. Export in 16:9, 4:5, or 1:1.</p></div></div></section><section id=\"templates\" class=\"px-6 md:px-12 py-[120px] max-w-[1200px] mx-auto\"><span class=\"font-[family-name:var(--font-mono)] text-xs tracking-[0.15em] uppercase text-[#d4a853]\">Templates</span><h2 class=\"font-[family-name:var(--font-display)] font-semibold leading-[1.2] tracking-tight mt-4 mb-4\" style=\"font-size:clamp(32px, 4vw, 48px)\">20+ Layouts Designed for Quotes</h2><p class=\"text-lg text-[#a09b94] max-w-[560px] leading-relaxed\">Not repurposed social media packs. Every template is built for readability, impact, and brand consistency.</p><div class=\"flex flex-wrap gap-3 mt-10 mb-10\"><button class=\"px-5 py-2 rounded-full text-sm font-medium border transition-all duration-200 border-[#d4a853] text-[#d4a853]\">All</button><button class=\"px-5 py-2 rounded-full text-sm font-medium border transition-all duration-200 border-[rgba(245,240,232,0.08)] text-[#a09b94] hover:border-[#d4a853] hover:text-[#d4a853]\">Minimal</button><button class=\"px-5 py-2 rounded-full text-sm font-medium border transition-all duration-200 border-[rgba(245,240,232,0.08)] text-[#a09b94] hover:border-[#d4a853] hover:text-[#d4a853]\">Editorial</button><button class=\"px-5 py-2 rounded-full text-sm font-medium border transition-all duration-200 border-[rgba(245,240,232,0.08)] text-[#a09b94] hover:border-[#d4a853] hover:text-[#d4a853]\">Bold</button><button class=\"px-5 py-2 rounded-full text-sm font-medium border transition-all duration-200 border-[rgba(245,240,232,0.08)] text-[#a09b94] hover:border-[#d4a853] hover:text-[#d4a853]\">Elegant</button></div><div class=\"grid grid-cols-2 md:grid-cols-4 gap-5\"><div class=\"group aspect-square bg-[#141416] border border-[rgba(245,240,232,0.08)] rounded-xl overflow-hidden relative cursor-pointer hover:border-[#d4a853] hover:scale-[1.03] transition-all duration-300\"><span class=\"absolute top-3 right-3 z-10 bg-[#0c0c0e] border border-[rgba(245,240,232,0.08)] rounded-lg px-2.5 py-1 text-[11px] text-[#6b6560] font-[family-name:var(--font-mono)]\">1:1 · 4:5 · 9:16 · 16:9</span><div class=\"w-full h-full flex flex-col justify-center items-center text-center p-5\" style=\"background:linear-gradient(135deg, #1a1a1c, #0c0c0e)\"><p class=\"font-[family-name:var(--font-display)] text-sm leading-relaxed text-[#f5f0e8]\">“<!-- -->Simplicity is the ultimate sophistication.<!-- -->”</p><div class=\"w-6 h-px bg-[#d4a853] my-2\"></div><span class=\"text-[10px] text-[#6b6560] tracking-[0.1em] uppercase\">Leonardo da Vinci</span></div><div class=\"absolute inset-0 bg-[rgba(12,12,14,0.9)] flex items-center justify-center text-[#d4a853] text-sm font-semibold opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100 transition-opacity duration-300\">Try this template</div></div><div class=\"group aspect-square bg-[#141416] border border-[rgba(245,240,232,0.08)] rounded-xl overflow-hidden relative cursor-pointer hover:border-[#d4a853] hover:scale-[1.03] transition-all duration-300\"><span class=\"absolute top-3 right-3 z-10 bg-[#0c0c0e] border border-[rgba(245,240,232,0.08)] rounded-lg px-2.5 py-1 text-[11px] text-[#6b6560] font-[family-name:var(--font-mono)]\">All sizes</span><div class=\"w-full h-full flex flex-col justify-center items-center text-center p-5\" style=\"background:linear-gradient(135deg, #2a1f1a, #1a1510)\"><p class=\"font-[family-name:var(--font-display)] text-sm leading-relaxed text-[#f5f0e8]\">“<!-- -->Act as if what you do makes a difference. It does.<!-- -->”</p><div class=\"w-6 h-px bg-[#d4a853] my-2\"></div><span class=\"text-[10px] text-[#6b6560] tracking-[0.1em] uppercase\">William James</span></div><div class=\"absolute inset-0 bg-[rgba(12,12,14,0.9)] flex items-center justify-center text-[#d4a853] text-sm font-semibold opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100 transition-opacity duration-300\">Try this template</div></div><div class=\"group aspect-square bg-[#141416] border border-[rgba(245,240,232,0.08)] rounded-xl overflow-hidden relative cursor-pointer hover:border-[#d4a853] hover:scale-[1.03] transition-all duration-300\"><span class=\"absolute top-3 right-3 z-10 bg-[#0c0c0e] border border-[rgba(245,240,232,0.08)] rounded-lg px-2.5 py-1 text-[11px] text-[#6b6560] font-[family-name:var(--font-mono)]\">All sizes</span><div class=\"w-full h-full flex flex-col justify-center items-center text-center p-5\" style=\"background:linear-gradient(135deg, #1a1c2a, #101520)\"><p class=\"font-[family-name:var(--font-display)] text-sm leading-relaxed text-[#f5f0e8]\">“<!-- -->The best way to predict the future is to create it.<!-- -->”</p><div class=\"w-6 h-px bg-[#d4a853] my-2\"></div><span class=\"text-[10px] text-[#6b6560] tracking-[0.1em] uppercase\">Peter Drucker</span></div><div class=\"absolute inset-0 bg-[rgba(12,12,14,0.9)] flex items-center justify-center text-[#d4a853] text-sm font-semibold opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100 transition-opacity duration-300\">Try this template</div></div><div class=\"group aspect-square bg-[#141416] border border-[rgba(245,240,232,0.08)] rounded-xl overflow-hidden relative cursor-pointer hover:border-[#d4a853] hover:scale-[1.03] transition-all dura